# area_opt.abc — Custom ABC optimization script for Sky130
# Applied after technology-independent synthesis, before cell mapping.
#
# NOTE: `map -a` forces ABC's *area-oriented* one-pass mapper instead of its
# default delay-oriented mapper. On this design that trades away timing
# margin we don't have (setup violations at max_ss_100C_1v60/nom_ss_100C_1v60)
# for area margin we do have (~49% utilization against a 60% density target).
# Dropping `-a` restores delay-driven mapping/area-recovery, which is what
# we actually need given the available area headroom.
strash
ifraig
rewrite -z
refactor -z
balance
rewrite -z
share
map
topo
stime
